        },
        {
          "text": " Ensi yoona, okuruga Geeba okuhika Rimoni aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo orwa Yerusaalemu, eryaba oruhita; kwonka Yerusaalemu eryaguma etunguukire eri omu mwanya gwayo, okuruga aha Irembo rya Benyamiini okuhika aha mwanya gw'eirembo ry'okubanza aha Irembo ry'Akeekubo, n'okuruga aha munaara gwa Hananeeli okuhika aha manyuukiro ga viinyo ag'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
