        {
          "text": " Kandi buri nyungu yoona ey'omuri Yerusaalemu n'ey'omuri Yuda eryaba eyereziibwe MUKAMA ow'amahe, boona abarikutamba baije batwareho zimwe kuziteekamu enyama z'ebitambo. Kandi eryo izooba tiharibaho Munyakanaani omu nju ya MUKAMA ow'amahe obundi.",
